:"","title":"Annual Report 2025","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/0e3a5b88-6f3b-4a5d-8d07-7186fd4b1f25.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2024","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/c2f11ada-795d-4215-acbf-3df412cdc882.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2023","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/0aa8e6e6-da93-48a3-a74d-9d50683dc2a7.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2022","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/524804/73589524804.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/524804/69269524804_25_08_21.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/524804/5248040320.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/524804/5248040319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/524804/5248040318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/524804/5248040317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/524804/5248040316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/524804/5248040315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/524804/5248040314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/524804/5248040313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://archives.nseindia.com/annual_reports/AR_541_AUROPHARMA_2012_2013_16072013115607.zip","source":"the data provider"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Aurobindo Pharma reported consolidated revenues of Rs. 9,150 crores, up 16% year-on-year, driven by broad-based performance across business segments. Operating EBITDA stood at Rs. 1,924 crores with a margin of 21%, while net profit reached Rs. 1,032 crores.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company reiterates its FY27 guidance for double-digit revenue growth, EBITDA margins north of 21%, and absolute EBITDA exceeding 8000.","quote":"We continue to reiterate our FY27 guidance to double-digit revenue growth, with EBITDA margins north of 21% and absolute EBITDA in excess of 8000, with potential upside driven by positive outperformance in our high-value strategic business areas.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"},{"claim":"Management expects the net effective tax rate to normalize around 28-29% by the end of the year.","quote":"However, we expect the tax rate to normalise around 28-29% by year-end.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"},{"claim":"The company expects EBITDA margins to sustain and progressively improve to north of 21% in FY27.","quote":"We expect EBITDA margins to sustain and progressively improve to north of 21%, reflecting the scale of our operations, execution capabilities and leveraging the new business lever.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=02f5135a-64d6-4a73-ab79-22338c70b732.pdf"},{"claim":"Management targets touching the $2 billion revenue milestone for the US business over the near term.","quote":"With these initiatives, our U.S. business is aiming to touch the $2 billion revenue milestone over the near term.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=02f5135a-64d6-4a73-ab79-22338c70b732.pdf"},{"claim":"The company anticipates European business momentum to remain strong going forward.","quote":"We expect the business momentum in the region to remain strong going forward.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=02f5135a-64d6-4a73-ab79-22338c70b732.pdf"},{"claim":"Management targets minimum double-digit growth for the European business.","quote":"So, we are definitely trying to achieve the double digit growth. And, of course, considering the current geopolitical situations, we have taken it bit conservatively but we are confident it will be minimum double digit.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=02f5135a-64d6-4a73-ab79-22338c70b732.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management stated that all growth market countries are driving growth in line with normal trends without any single extraordinary performer.","quote":"All the growth market countries are driving growth in line with the normal. There is no specific country which is growing extraordinarily like that.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"},{"claim":"The company expects higher sales for antibiotics in the upcoming months.","quote":"So, to answer your question, the upcoming months will see higher sales for antibiotics.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"},{"claim":"US base business growth was driven by volume gains and new product launches during the quarter.","quote":"U.S. base business continued to grow driven by volume gains and new launches","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=01076371-b3b6-4225-ab1c-485173891041.pdf"},{"claim":"Management remains encouraged by the stability across core businesses and ongoing strategic progress.","quote":"As we look ahead, we remain encouraged by the stability across our core businesses and the continued progress on our strategic priorities.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=02f5135a-64d6-4a73-ab79-22338c70b732.pdf"},{"claim":"U.S. base business is supported by a large product portfolio helping maintain price stability.","quote":"Our large product portfolio helps us to maintain optimally the price stability.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=02f5135a-64d6-4a73-ab79-22338c70b732.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"Net CapEx for the quarter stood at $78 million, with capital expenditure focused mainly towards TheraNym Biologics.","quote":"Net CapEx for the quarter stood at $78 million. Capital expenditure remained focused mainly towards TheraNym Biologics.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"},{"claim":"Production at the China OSD facility doubled over the past 12 months.","quote":"Further production at our China OSD facility doubled over past 12 months, making a significant milestone in the ramp-up of one of our strategic investments for sustained growth.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"},{"claim":"Net capex for the quarter was US$ 78 million primarily towards capability enhancements and new business developments.","quote":"Net Capex of US$ 78 million* primarily towards capability enhancements, new business developments","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=01076371-b3b6-4225-ab1c-485173891041.pdf"},{"claim":"Ground-breaking was completed for a greenfield Drug Substance facility as part of the third product schedule with MSD.","quote":"As part of the third product schedule with MSD, ground-breaking completed for a greenfield Drug Substance facility.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=01076371-b3b6-4225-ab1c-485173891041.pdf"},{"claim":"Unit 2 is estimated at USD 180 million in capex and is targeted to be ready for qualification in 2030.","quote":"Unit 2 is estimated at USD 180 Mn in capex, targeted to be ready for qualification in 2030.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=01076371-b3b6-4225-ab1c-485173891041.pdf"},{"claim":"Net CapEx for the quarter was $82 million and for the year was around $341 million.","quote":"Net CapEx for the quarter is $82 million and for the year around $341 million, which includes capacity enhancement projects and plant expenses and CMO project.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=02f5135a-64d6-4a73-ab79-22338c70b732.pdf"},{"claim":"Unit-1 of the biological CDMO unit is expected to be commissioned by the end of this year.","quote":"Satakarni Makkapati: Hi. About the CDMO unit, the Unit-1 will be commissioned by end of this year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=02f5135a-64d6-4a73-ab79-22338c70b732.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Gross margin remained resilient at 60.4% compared to 58.8% in Q1 FY26, benefiting from an improved business mix and operating efficiency.","quote":"Gross margin remained resilient at 60.4% compared to 58.8% of Q1 FY26, benefiting from an improved business mix and operating efficiency.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"},{"claim":"Average finance cost declined to 4.8% from 5% in the previous quarter due to prudent treasury management.","quote":"Our average finance cost declined to 4.8% from 5% in the previous quarter, reflecting prudent treasury management.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"},{"claim":"Operating EBITDA, exploring one-time impact of Rs. 43 crores towards a loss on derecognition of leased residuals, stood at Rs. 1,924 crores with a margin of 21%.","quote":"Operating EBITDA, exploring one-time impact of Rs. 43 crores towards a loss on derecognition of leased residuals, stood at Rs. 1,924 crores with a margin of 21%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"},{"claim":"Operating EBITDA stood at ₹1,924 Cr with a margin of 21.0%.","quote":"Operating EBITDA stood at ₹1,924 Cr with a margin of 21.0%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=01076371-b3b6-4225-ab1c-485173891041.pdf"},{"claim":"Gross margin for Q1 FY27 was 60.4% compared to 58.8% in Q1 FY26.","quote":"Gross Margin 60.4% 58.8% 153 bps","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=01076371-b3b6-4225-ab1c-485173891041.pdf"},{"claim":"For FY26, EBITDA margin was 20.4%, supported by a favourable product-business mix and other factors.","quote":"For FY26, revenues stood at ₹33,653 crores, while EBITDA came in at ₹6,856 crores, translating into a healthy EBITDA margin of 20.4%, which is in line with the revenue as well as EBITDA gainer for FY26, supported by favourable product-business mix and other factors.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=02f5135a-64d6-4a73-ab79-22338c70b732.pdf"},{"claim":"Gross margin for Q4 FY26 stood at 61.3%, increasing by 153 bps quarter-on-quarter.","quote":"Gross margin stood at 61.3%, increased by 153 bps quarter on quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=02f5135a-64d6-4a73-ab79-22338c70b732.pdf"},{"claim":"Gross contribution reached the highest absolute level of ₹20,165 crores for the year, reflecting a margin of 60%.","quote":"Gross contribution also reached the highest ever absolute level of ₹20,165 crores, reflecting a margin of 60%, that is an improvement of around 100 bps.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=02f5135a-64d6-4a73-ab79-22338c70b732.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The company launched 10 new products, filed 9 ANDAs, and received 10 final approvals in the U.S. during the quarter.","quote":"We launched 10 new products this quarter. Filed 9 ANDAs, received 10 final approvals, indicating strong pipeline execution and regulatory momentum.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"},{"claim":"Based on current operating levels, annualized Pen-G production is expected to exceed 10,000 metric tons with capacity utilization exceeding 80%.","quote":"Based on current operating levels, we expect, annualized production, Pen-G production, to exceed 10,000 metric tons with a capacity utilization level exceeding 80% at consistent yields.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=02f5135a-64d6-4a73-ab79-22338c70b732.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The company maintained a net cash position of $42 million after payments of $85 million towards buyback and $247 million for the Lannett acquisition.","quote":"Our balance sheet continues to remain strong with a strong net cash position of $42 million after payment of $85 million towards buyback and $247 million for Lannett acquisition, reinforcing our strong financial resilience and focus on various accretive growth opportunities while maintaining a disciplined capital structure.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"},{"claim":"The company generated free cash flow of US$ 98 million during the quarter.","quote":"Generated free cash flow of US$ 98mn during the quarter, with a strong net cash position (including investments) of ~US$ 42 million* as on 30-Jun-26, after payment of cash for Lannett acquisition of US$ 247 million and buyback of US$ 85 million","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=01076371-b3b6-4225-ab1c-485173891041.pdf"},{"claim":"The net cash position of the investment at the end of March 2026 improved to $317 million from $276 million in December 2025.","quote":"As a result, the net cash position of the investment at the end of March’26 improved to $317 million from the net cash position of $276 million in December’25.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=02f5135a-64d6-4a73-ab79-22338c70b732.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Management noted that the 